edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":1409,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":19,"text":"Een onrustige wereld stelt Vin en Elend voor nieuwe vragen over de macht die zij hebben bevochten. Terwijl asregens en aardbevingen het bestaan bedreigen, zoeken zij naar kennis die hun voorgangers hebben achtergelaten. Vin draagt de gevolgen van haar eerdere keuzes met zich mee. Elend probeert te begrijpen hoe hij anderen kan beschermen tegen een gevaar dat steeds moeilijker te doorgronden wordt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/141156/de-held-van-weleer.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022580301","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022580301"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1911,"title":"Rijk van stormen","isbn_13":"9789022580301","isbn_10":"902258030X","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022580301","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789022580301"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1835782/rijk-van-stormen.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Retained reviewed prior identity/edition/content evidence"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL26319926M","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Retained reviewed prior identity/edition/content evidence"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000522982_Rijk_van_stormen_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","sha256":"292cce9470eb057d355de7f7a45d712edd1ad78379e602a7cb832d8ae7de8578","bytes":318127,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789022580301","work_id":1911,"bound_author_id":125,"bound_title":"Rijk van stormen","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789022580301","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000522982_Rijk_van_stormen_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1835782/rijk-van-stormen.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1911:nl","key":{"work_id":1911,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1835782/rijk-van-stormen.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Retained reviewed prior identity/edition/content evidence"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL26319926M","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Retained reviewed prior identity/edition/content evidence"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000522982_Rijk_van_stormen_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","sha256":"292cce9470eb057d355de7f7a45d712edd1ad78379e602a7cb832d8ae7de8578","bytes":318127,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":1911,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":125,"text":"Aelin heeft haar plaats als erfgename opgeëist, maar een koninkrijk terugwinnen vraagt meer dan een naam en een belofte. Zij moet leidinggeven aan haar hof en bondgenoten bijeenhouden terwijl Erawan haar verleden en relaties tegen haar gebruikt. De strijd dwingt haar om persoonlijke verlangens af te wegen tegen het lot van haar wereld, met steeds minder ruimte voor een veilige keuze.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1835782/rijk-van-stormen.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022580318","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022580318"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":1912,"title":"Toren van de dageraad","isbn_13":"9789022580318","isbn_10":"9022580318","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022580318","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:978902258