"bound_author_id":125,"text":"Na ingrijpende verwondingen zoekt Chaol Westfall hulp bij de genezers van de Torre Cesme in Antica. Zijn reis naar het zuidelijke rijk heeft ook een politiek doel: steun vinden voor een dreigende oorlog. Terwijl herstel hem dwingt anders naar zichzelf te kijken, ontdekt hij dat de problemen rond hem groter zijn dan zijn eigen toekomst. Dit deel volgt een andere verhaallijn dan Aelins gelijktijdige strijd.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1835783/toren-van-de-dageraad.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789024580477","key":{"isbn_13":"9789024580477"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2228,"title":"De Stenen Hemel","isbn_13":"9789024580477","isbn_10":"9024580471","language":"nld","publisher":"Luitingh-Sijthoff B.V., Uitgeverij"}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789024580477","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789024580477"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1198623/de-gebroken-aarde-3-de-stenen-hemel.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Retained reviewed prior identity/edition/content evidence"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL26461538M","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Retained reviewed prior identity/edition/content evidence"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000527125_De_Stenen_Hemel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","sha256":"5957f14d2a31a676d12c22ef99c965722690f3bdab44a1e9191eba24b7089893","bytes":577324,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"edition_id":"@edition:9789024580477","work_id":2228,"bound_author_id":24,"bound_title":"De Stenen Hemel","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789024580477","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000527125_De_Stenen_Hemel_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1198623/de-gebroken-aarde-3-de-stenen-hemel.html"}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2228:nl","key":{"work_id":2228,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T00:00:00+01:00","review_batch":"nl-cohort003-04-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1198623/de-gebroken-aarde-3-de-stenen-hemel.html","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Retained reviewed prior identity/edition/content evidence"},{"url":"https://openlibrary.org/books/OL26461538M","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","fact":"Retained reviewed prior identity/edition/content evidence"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000527125_De_Stenen_Hemel_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-10-31","sha256":"5957f14d2a31a676d12c22ef99c965722690f3bdab44a1e9191eba24b7089893","bytes":577324,"fact":"Manual title/author/exact edition cover binding, readable published front"}],"work_id":2228,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":24,"text":"De terugkeer van de maan brengt een beslissende verandering dichterbij. Essun wil haar dochter Nassun terugvinden en een toekomst mogelijk maken waarin hun bijzondere vermogens niet tot vervolging leiden. Nassun heeft intussen eigen ervaringen opgedaan met het geweld van de wereld en trekt daar andere conclusies uit. Hun verschillende antwoorden bepalen de inzet van het slotdeel van De Gebroken Aarde.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1198623/de-gebroken-aarde-3-de-stenen-hemel.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary"}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789022575130","key":{"isbn_13":"9789022575130"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":2532,"title":"De wapens van het licht","isbn_13":"9789022575130","isbn_10":"9022575136","language":"nld","publisher":"Meulenhoff Boekerij B.V."}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789022575130","key":{"e